{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Role chain & workflow\n`SUPER ADMIN → ADMIN → SELLER → EMPLOYEE`\nSource: `docs/ROADMAP.md` · `/todo` · `/todo-sync`\n**Next:** §2 Admin\nStatus: ☐ not done · ☑ done","x":0,"y":0,"width":1680,"height":110},
		{"id":"sec_1","type":"text","text":"## §1 Super Admin\n**Status: DONE** (8/8)\n\n☑ All WH/shops/staff\n\n☑ Manage warehouses\n\n☑ Stock any WH\n\n☑ Adjust any shop\n\n☑ Oversee Admins\n\n☑ Sell + accept\n\n☑ PDF all day/wk/mo\n\n☑ GPS all checked-in","x":240,"y":130,"width":240,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_2","type":"text","text":"## §2 Admin\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/8)\n\n☐ Own shop only\n\n☐ Add shop no WH\n\n☐ Own staff/stock\n\n☐ Sell + accept\n\n☐ Manage staff\n\n☐ Bills via §5\n\n☐ PDF shop day/wk/mo\n\n☐ GPS shop checked-in","x":500,"y":130,"width":240,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_3","type":"text","text":"## §3 Seller\n**Status: PARTIAL** (2/5)\n\n☑ Bill/history/returns\n\n☑ Accept shipment\n\n☐ Re-scope own stock\n\n☐ Staff = Admin chain\n\n☐ Use §5 upgrades","x":760,"y":130,"width":240,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"sec_4","type":"text","text":"## §4 Employee\n**Status: PARTIAL** (3/7)\n\n☑ Check-in/out\n\n☑ Location stock\n\n☑ No accept ship\n\n☐ Create bill\n\n☐ Same serial rules\n\n☐ No SA/Admin UI\n\n☐ Off-site via §5","x":1020,"y":130,"width":240,"height":380,"color":"3"},
